From 4ea36e5a4c3c5c08e611537e368e926899bf1bec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:43:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: type public Tor control lifecycle diagnostics

Convert 25 shared eCash Tor producers while preserving the original text,
severity, category, expressions and protocol/control flow. Public onion service
identifiers, control addresses and key/cookie file paths receive typed fields;
private key and cookie contents never do. Native V2 removes Tor: this commit
belongs before that removal and must not restore Tor or its tests there.

Leave four authentication-transcript/raw-reply sites unchanged for a separate
privacy review. In particular SanitizeString is not secret redaction.

Add a public TorControlConnection invalid-address regression asserting the
false result, no callbacks, and actual JSON metadata without opening a socket.

Scripted-diff commands (run at the source parent):
/private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/convert.py --root . --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/tor-public-lifecycle-diagnostics.json --report /Users/shammah/repos/lotus-v2-repair-work/logging-network/tor-public-source.json --apply
git clang-format --force --binary /opt/homebrew/bin/clang-format --style '{BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig, BreakStringLiterals: false}' HEAD -- src/torcontrol.cpp src/test/torcontrol_tests.cpp
python3 test/lint/lint-log-events.py src/torcontrol.cpp
git diff --check

The rule catalog and focused test are authored inputs to the scripted change.
Source checks: exact AST conversion, 38 production event lint sites and diff
whitespace pass. Native compilation and the authored regression: NOT RUN.
---
